config SERVICE_IMAGING_PICTURES
    bool "Album art and notification pictures"
    depends on SCREEN_COLOR_DEPTH_BITS_8
    default y if PLATFORM_EMERY || PLATFORM_GABBRO
    help
      Show album art in the music app and pictures in notifications, fetched
      from the phone through the imaging endpoint at the watch's size, 4 bits
      per pixel. Needs a color display, and room in the kernel heap for one
      decoded image at a time; an image that does not fit is dropped and the
      text-only layout shown.
